From 9e35bd9f244c8030bbfc1436d8b49f1e0e6f449b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:20:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 595/638] media/audio/aros: AHI output backend

AudioManagerAros with AhiOutputStream over ahi.device (CMD_WRITE on
AHI_DEFAULT_UNIT, double-buffered requests on a dedicated render thread).
CreateAudioManager() probes the unit and keeps FakeAudioManager when it
cannot be opened, so media pacing is unchanged on systems without an AHI
driver configured.
